  unitName: Countess Jade (EU)
  unitId: 730144
  unitNumber: 7067
  description: "Countess Jade of the Cruel Forest and the Crimson Fort is now a rich
    Noblesse. She is surrounded by her courtiers and people admire her for her strengths
    and powers. Her only concern is that of the persistent rumors about her husband\u2019s
    whereabouts."
  summonDesc: What men can do for love...
  fusionDesc: Me? Strong? Don't believe those petty rumors....
